     *
     * <pre>
     * CSVFormat format = aformat.withHeader();</pre>
     *
     * or specified manually with:
     *
     * <pre>
     * CSVFormat format = aformat.withHeader(&quot;name&quot;, &quot;email&quot;, &quot;phone&quot;);</pre>
