     * </p>
     *
     * <pre>
     * CSVFormat fmt = CSVFormat.newBuilder(EXCEL).withDelimiter(';');
     * </pre>
     *
     * <p>
     * Settings are:
     * </p>
     * <ul>
     * <li>withDelimiter(',')</li>
     * <li>withQuoteChar('"')</li>
     * <li>withRecordSeparator(CRLF)</li>
