     * records.
     * </li>
     * <li>
     * <strong>Writing:</strong> Writes {@code null} as the given {@code nullString} when writing records.</li>
     * </ul>
     *
     * @return the String to convert to and from {@code null}. No substitution occurs if {@code null}
